Modifications for this product:
- Only the personal WeChat (weixin) channel is retained; the Feishu integration and all
  other IM channel adapters and UI were removed.
- The plugin now hosts exactly one WeChat channel, exposes a sidebar menu item instead
  of a workspace tab, and blocks adding a second channel until the current one is removed.
- Runtime identifiers, state directories, credential references, HTTP routes, client
  module ids, locale namespaces, CSS prefixes, and session id prefixes were renamed so
  this plugin can run independently alongside dsh-im-connect and dsh-feishu-channels.

